# 5. proof representation

## 5.1 Relation

```text
Relation(
  lhs,
  rhs,
  relation_type,
  source,
  note,
)
```

`RelationType`:

```text
EQUALITY
ZERO
ORDER
INEQUALITY
```

## 5.2 ProofStep

authoritative machine proof node:

```text
ProofStep(
  conclusion,
  premises,
  rule,
  note,
  inference_rule,
)
```

proof meaning の中心は:

```text
conclusion
premises
rule
inference_rule
```

にある。

## 5.3 ProofRule

主要:

```text
GIVEN
RELATION
INFERENCE
EXACTNESS
EHP_EXACTNESS
KERNEL_COMPUTATION
IMAGE_COMPUTATION
COKERNEL_COMPUTATION
```

`GIVEN` と `INFERENCE` は現在の provenance の重要な境界だが、将来の:

```text
derived
proved
imported
assumed
```

分類と単純に同一視しない。

