```text
BoundedProducerSearchStatus
BoundedProducerSearchDiagnostic
BoundedProducerSearchReport
```

search failure:

```text
NO_FINAL_RULE
AMBIGUOUS_FINAL_RULE
NO_PRODUCER
UNSAFE_PRODUCER
AMBIGUOUS_PRODUCER
CYCLE_DETECTED
DEPTH_LIMIT
PRODUCER_RETRY_EXHAUSTED
```

