# 20. query architecture — Phase 90

Phase 90 で `TodaGroupQuery` と known-result lookup を追加。

## 20.1 TodaGroupQuery

module:

```text
toda_group_query.py
```

representation:

```text
TodaGroupQuery(
  n: int,
  k: int,
)
```

immutable:

```text
@dataclass(frozen=True)
```

validation:

```text
n is int and not bool
n >= 1

k is int and not bool
k >= 0
```

target:

```text
query.target
=
TodaPrimaryGroup(
  group_dimension=n+k,
  sphere_dimension=n,
)
```

責務:

```text
input validation
target construction
```

非責務:

```text
proof search
group computation
presentation
repository mutation
```

